    SCH -->|"trigger 00:00 setiap hari<br/>(FR-04-03)"| P8
    D2 -->|"cek kedaluwarsa KTPP/SKCK"| P8
    D1 -->|"data akun & status"| P8
    P8 -->|"update status user (suspended)"| D1
    P8 -->|"notifikasi auto-suspend"| A

